[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730341372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2730341372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2730341372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ivbP8","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T17:31:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T17:31:26Z","body":"> Can you share some information about the test you ran?\r\n\r\nJust use the test project above, it create 100000 nodes with empty `_process` overriden, so `_gdvirtual_process_call` is called a lot every frame. Both master and PR have stable 25 FPS on my computer.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730341372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730442229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2730442229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2730442229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ivz31","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T18:12:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T18:13:43Z","body":"> > We can represent them with one single pointer with an invalid pointer value (I choose `(uintptr_t)-1` here):\r\n> \r\n> This _seems_ fine as an invalid value, since a real function couldn't fit up at this address.\r\n\r\nThere is some prior art for this, for example:\r\n- the `MAP_FAILED` sentinel value in [`mmap(2)`](https://www.man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/mmap.2.html). \r\n- `INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE` in the Windows SDK ([doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/winbase/nf-winbase-createfilemappinga), [source](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Atpn%2Fwinsdk-10%20INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE&type=code))\r\n\r\nThat said, I'm not sure how portable that is, or if it's theoretically well-defined behavior to compare such pointers. In practice it likely works.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n@YYF233333 nice optimization! :+1: ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730442229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737056772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2737056772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2737056772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJCwE","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:23:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T15:23:46Z","body":"> Just use the test project above, it create 100000 nodes with empty `_process` overriden, so `_gdvirtual_process_call` is called a lot every frame. Both master and PR have stable 25 FPS on my computer.\r\n\r\nI was able to reproduce this too - thanks!\r\n\r\nOverall, this seems good to me. I think the only open question is if we're OK with using `(void *)(uintptr_t)-1` as the invalid value. It seems like it should be fine to me, but I'd love feedback from the core team - if no one responds here before then, I'll bring it up at the core team meeting next week.\r\n\r\nIf `(void *)(uintptr_t)-1` isn't OK for some reason, one option we talked about at the GDExtension meeting was declaring a real function and using its address as the sentinel value to represent invalid.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737056772/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764830661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2764830661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2764830661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ky_fF","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T00:22:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T00:56:30Z","body":"Hi, sorry, I created a duplicate without noticing this PR existed.\r\nOur 2 PRs are extremely similar, just slightly different implementation details.\r\nI'm fine closing mine, but you might be interested in also removing the StringName from the instance, like I did. It will improve the size of Godot objects even more.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764830661/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766123490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2766123490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2766123490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k37Hi","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:48:11Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T12:48:11Z","body":"Hi @CedNaru, I've made the `StringName` static. This PR is currently waiting for core team feedback. Since our implementation is a bit different I think we can keep both around and let maintainers decide which one they want to take.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766123490/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766139916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2766139916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2766139916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k3_IM","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:55:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T12:55:12Z","body":"By the way. I tried your approach of having a static StringName defined at the class level, but it couldn't run because StringName (its static cache) is not initialized yet at that point so I had to fallback to a local static in the functions. You didn't run into the same issue ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766139916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766149778","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2766149778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2766149778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k4BiS","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:59:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T12:59:17Z","body":"Oh, you're right! Looks like I can't take the easy way out 😆","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766149778/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776347295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776347295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776347295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6le7Kf","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T16:29:06Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T16:29:06Z","body":"Btw, I have a question. What is the purpose of this VirtualMethodTracker class ? They are created by the virtual method implementations, but I don't see them being used anywhere in the engine ?\r\nI have an idea to optimize things even further, but that would require moving the method tracking directly to the GDExtension itself, do we really need that tracker on a per instance basis ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776347295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776402731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776402731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776402731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lfIsr","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T16:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T16:51:18Z","body":"> Btw, I have a question. What is the purpose of this VirtualMethodTracker class ? They are created by the virtual method implementations, but I don't see them being used anywhere in the engine ?\r\n\r\nThey are used for hot-reloading a GDExtension: it goes through every instance and clears the function pointers","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776402731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776443634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776443634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776443634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lfSry","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T17:10:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T17:14:14Z","body":"So theoretically, we could drop storing the function pointer in the class instance directly and cache them in the gdextension instead ?\r\nThat would run the initialization for the function pointer only once per method at the extension level instead of doing it for every single instance, and we would decrease the memory footprint even more. The actual class instance would retrieve it on the fly using the StringName of the method afterward. Hashmap using StringNames as a key are quite fast because there the hash is already computed in the StringName, so there would be close to zero performance penalty (and actually a gain in the case of the first call, many methods like enter_tree are usually call only once anyway) for a large reduction of the memory used by Objects.\r\n\r\nThe memory cost of a gdvirtual method would drop to 0 that way.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776443634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776497649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776497649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776497649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lff3x","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T17:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T17:36:13Z","body":"> So theoretically, we could drop storing the function pointer in the class instance directly and cache them in the gdextension instead ?\r\n\r\nTheoretically, yes, but it is important that virtual functions are called very performantly, since this is what is used for things like `_process()` and `_physics_process()`\r\n\r\n> Hashmap using StringNames as a key are quite fast because there the hash is already computed in the StringName, so there would be close to zero performance penalty\r\n\r\nWe'd have to ask @reduz or @vnen to know for sure, but I suspect that a `HashMap` may have been avoided on purpose, specifically for performance reasons\r\n\r\nI'd recommend discussing this in a separate PR or issue, since I think what we have on the current PR is pretty uncontroversial, whereas this other change may turn out to be controversial","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776497649/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776537480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776537480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776537480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lfpmI","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T17:54:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T18:38:22Z","body":"Yeah, this current PR seems good to me. I'll try to implement what I proposed and will benchmark a dummy gdextension in another PR once this one is merged.\r\n\r\nOne little extra thing that could be changed that I made in the other PR. \r\nRight now, this PR is trying to check if we can call the method pointer outside the `if(get_extension())` \r\nThat part could be moved inside as we are never going to try calling a virtual method if there is no extension in the first place. That will also remove the nullpointer check before trying to call it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776537480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776641443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2776641443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2776641443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lgC-j","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T18:45:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T18:45:28Z","body":"> One little extra thing that could be changed that I made in the other PR. Right now, this PR is trying to check if we can call the method pointer outside the `if(get_extension())` That part could be moved inside as we are never going to try calling a virtual method if there no extension in the first place. That will also also to remove the nullpointer check before trying to call it.\r\n\r\nMy brain didn’t catch up right away, so it took me some time to understand this. 😅 Good point.\r\n\r\nIf anyone review this in browser I recommand to enable that \"Hide Whitespace\" option to get a clearer view.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776641443/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780190182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2780190182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2780190182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ltlXm","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T04:13:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T17:01:41Z","body":"I made a small benchmark to test the difference with master with both a regular Node and a Node Extension with `enter_tree` and `_process` implemented (they just increment a counter). I ran it on 100K of each.\r\nI measured 4 things:\r\n- The allocation time\r\n- The `_enter_tree` time\r\n- The first `_process` call before caching.\r\n- The second `_process`  call after caching.\r\n\r\n| Class  | Allocation (ms) | _enter_tree (ms) | 1st _process (us) | 2nd _process (us)| \r\n| ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| Node  | 111 -> 79 | 26 -> 25 | 35 -> 33 | 17 ->  10|\r\n| Extension  | 138 -> 103  | 182 -> 180 | 40590 -> 35872 | 4230 -> 3977 |\r\n\r\nThere is quite a bit of variation between runs so I used the average of 3 runs.\r\n\r\nAlso a reminder of the difference in size with this change;\r\nNode: \r\n- Before -> 1072 Bytes\r\n- After -> 912 Bytes\r\n\r\nControl:\r\n- Before -> 2560 Bytes\r\n- After -> 2240 Bytes\r\n\r\nPhysicsDirectBodyState3DExtension (mostly made of virtual methods) :\r\n- Before -> 1520 Bytes\r\n- After -> 784 Bytes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780190182/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787223169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264#issuecomment-2787223169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","id":2787223169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mIaaB","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T17:48:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T17:48:03Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787223169/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]